            {
               "text": "#### Praticando com a *Yupana*\n\nAgora é a sua vez. Use o seletor abaixo para escolher a operação que deseja praticar: **Somar**, **Multiplicar** ou **Subtrair**. O aplicativo proporá um cálculo e orientará você passo a passo em uma Yupana de quatro linhas, em que cada linha representa um dígito (de 0 a 9).\n\nUse **Novo Exercício** para iniciar outro cálculo, **Próximo Nível** para mudar a dificuldade, **Reiniciar** para reiniciar o cálculo atual e **Próximo Passo** para continuar após concluir cada etapa. Ao final, o resultado é mostrado na Yupana.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<style>.yupana-panel { background: #2e241f; border-radius: 50px; padding: 8px 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 15px; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 3px 6px rgba(255,245,190,0.3); } .yupana-panel .exercise-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; } .level-badge { background: #ffb347; color: #1f2a0e; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 3vw, 1rem); white-space: nowrap; } .problem-display { background: #f2ecd8; padding: 4px 16px; border-radius: 35px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: bold; font-size: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem); color: #1f2a0e; white-space: nowrap; } .ex-btn { background: #846b4e; border: none; color: #ffefcf; font-weight: bold; font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 2.5vw, 0.9rem); font-family: inherit; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; } .ex-btn:hover { background: #a58a6a; transform: scale(1.03); } .ex-btn.hidden { display: none; } .step-panel { padding: 8px 0; color: #ffefcf; font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 2.5vw, 1rem); } .step-status { font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 2vw, 0.85rem); opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 4px; color: #ffefcf; } .feedback-area { text-align: center; margin: 10px 0; font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 3vw, 1.2rem); } .congrats { color: #2e7d32; font-weight: bold; } .success-message { color: #fff; } .next-step-btn { display: block; margin: 10px auto; background: #2e7d32; border: none; color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 3vw, 1.1rem); font-family: inherit; padding: 10px 30px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; } .next-step-btn:hover { background: #388e3c; transform: scale(1.03); } .next-step-btn.hidden { display: none; } #yupana1 { zoom: 0.7; }</style><p><center><input type=\"radio\" value=\"sum\" name=\"yupanaop\" checked=\"checked\" /> <b>Somar</b> <input type=\"radio\" value=\"mult\" name=\"yupanaop\" /> <b>Multiplicar</b> <input type=\"radio\" value=\"sub\" name=\"yupanaop\" /> <b>Subtrair</b></center></p><p><table id=\"yupana1\" class=\"tawapukllay\"><tr><th colspan=\"4\"><i>Yupana</i></th></tr> <tr id=\"tf1\"><td id=\"tc1f1\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f1\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f1\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f1\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf2\"><td id=\"tc1f2\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f2\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f2\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f2\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf3\"><td id=\"tc1f3\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f3\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f3\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f3\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf4\"><td id=\"tc1f4\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span